1
00:00:32,561 --> 00:00:36,621
World's moving fast - won't even meet your eyes,

2
00:00:39,961 --> 00:00:45,122
Words fade away somewhere in the night.

3
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:54,062
But there's one small spark, simple and true -

4
00:00:54,082 --> 00:01:01,022
“Thank you” holds stronger than arms that hold you.

5
00:01:01,182 --> 00:01:08,022
Say it real quiet - it changes the road,

6
00:01:08,062 --> 00:01:16,443
Say it right on time - it lightens the load.

7
00:01:16,483 --> 00:01:21,763
Not a crown, not thunder, not noise in the room,

8
00:01:23,823 --> 00:01:31,943
Just “thank you” - and watch how the whole world blooms.

9
00:01:32,343 --> 00:01:36,703
Today’s Thank You Day - no walls in the way,

10
00:01:36,763 --> 00:01:42,184
No flags, no crowns - just hearts on display.

11
00:01:42,204 --> 00:01:47,344
For light in the dark, for a hand on the way,

12
00:01:47,724 --> 00:01:52,664
“Thank you” drops harder than bass we can play.

13
00:01:52,704 --> 00:01:56,564
Today’s Thank You Day - say it out loud,

14
00:01:56,624 --> 00:02:04,524
To the ones who stood with you deep in the crowd.

15
00:02:05,444 --> 00:02:11,105
The world isn't perfect, but one thing is true:

16
00:02:11,125 --> 00:02:16,545
“Thank you” holds stronger than anything new.

17
00:02:17,565 --> 00:02:21,285
For mornings with calm, for evenings with glow,

18
00:02:21,325 --> 00:02:24,865
For the ones who stayed, and the ones who let go.

19
00:02:24,965 --> 00:02:28,545
For hands in the work, for faith without proof,

20
00:02:28,645 --> 00:02:31,705
For standing your ground when the storms hit the roof.

21
00:02:32,385 --> 00:02:36,145
We move through the day, say “maybe later,”

22
00:02:36,305 --> 00:02:40,166
Thinking “one day… I’ll finally say it to you.”

23
00:02:40,686 --> 00:02:44,406
But time never waits, it runs straight through -

24
00:02:44,426 --> 00:02:49,846
And sometimes a “thank you” is long overdue.

25
00:02:49,886 --> 00:02:54,126
Today’s Thank You Day - no breaks in the line,

26
00:02:54,166 --> 00:02:57,226
For close ones and strangers, for yours and for mine.

27
00:02:57,286 --> 00:03:00,866
For simply being there, for saying “I’m here,”

28
00:03:00,886 --> 00:03:07,586
“Thank you” shines brighter than anything near.

29
00:03:07,686 --> 00:03:13,667
Today’s Thank You Day - not made for display,

30
00:03:13,847 --> 00:03:16,027
But for people who live the honest way.

31
00:03:16,347 --> 00:03:23,367
Let the world go quiet for a moment or two,

32
00:03:23,627 --> 00:03:32,187
While we say together: thank you… thank you.

33
00:03:34,907 --> 00:03:40,148
Not a like, not a share, not words on a screen,

34
00:03:42,248 --> 00:03:47,468
Just a real human voice, honest and clean.

35
00:03:49,528 --> 00:03:55,308
Sometimes “thank you” is all we can do -

36
00:03:57,148 --> 00:04:03,408
And sometimes it's everything pulling us through.

37
00:04:03,528 --> 00:04:10,009
Don’t know how to start? - keep it simple and true.

38
00:04:10,689 --> 00:04:13,069
Just say: thank you.

39
00:04:15,049 --> 00:04:16,889
Say it again -

40
00:04:18,769 --> 00:04:22,149
thank you.

41
00:04:22,409 --> 00:04:23,849
One more time -

42
00:04:26,149 --> 00:04:29,409
thank you.

43
00:04:29,849 --> 00:04:31,329
Let it echo…

44
00:04:33,589 --> 00:04:40,850
thank you… thank you…

45
00:04:40,910 --> 00:04:46,290
thank you… thank you… thank you…

